WEBVTT

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:30.520
I'm back.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:31.980
Hey, everyone.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.610
Hey, how could you abandon me
like that?

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:39.280
But I'm back now!

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:48.620
Behold, the 7.6 billion people
of the world!

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:51.870
Nineteen years late,
but the feared king returns!

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:55.790
You shall look at me
for a glimpse of Angolmois!

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:59.340
This is my latest ultimate
killer technique!

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.420
Super, delicious, cosmic, golden,

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:05.510
special reserve, gorgeous,
ultra, hyper-mega,

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:08.260
marvelous, fantastic,

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:11.390
overload, Giga Drill meteor!

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:28.490
No problem, c'est bon,
está bien, everything's all right!

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:32.660
Finally! The ultimate
Jashin-chan dropkick!

00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:03.570
My Noel!

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:04.950
Hey, everyone!

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:06.950
Thank you so much!

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:10.780
This can't be!

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:12.410
Sorry, ma'am.

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:14.200
We won't forget again.

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.540
Don't worry about it.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:19.880
Congratulations!

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.170
We have a jackpot here!

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:25.720
Here's your prize.

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:30.470
A two-day VIP experience
at a private beach!

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:47.150
Damn it.

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:48.610
END

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:51.370
Beth!

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:53.870
It's time to eat!

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:57.910
Huh?

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:00.880
Did you get bigger...?

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:04.550
I feel like she was smaller
before I went to space.

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:09.630
That means we gotta build you
a bigger house.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:14.390
I keep forgetting
she's the Beast of Gévaudan.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:17.890
Forget the house,
we're gonna need a cage.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:23.480
How the hell am I supposed
to control such a big beast?

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:26.530
I'll end up as her dinner!

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:31.740
I'll get rid of her while I can!

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:34.280
It's been a drag taking you on walks,

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:37.540
feeding you expensive food...
Now's the perfect time.

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:39.370
Goodbye, Beth!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:43.290
Equally fatal
as my infamous dropkick!

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:46.300
The Royal Copenhagen!

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:53.050
Don't look so innocent
when I'm about to kill you!

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:57.060
She completely trusts me
as her owner.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:01.060
But I can't afford to wait
any longer.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.360
How could I do that to you?

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:09.940
I've gotten so attached
while taking care of her.

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:15.700
A lordly beast is living,

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:18.620
leashed up,
stripped of freedom.

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.620
You're just like me.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:25.380
I'm sorry, Beth.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.380
What is it?

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:32.130
Quit that! That tickles.

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:35.720
I said stop-- Huh?

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:48.900
She needs to die, now!

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:51.570
I still got my left hand.

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:56.910
Take this!
The Lefty Royal Copenhagen!

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.330
No effect at all.

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:05.580
-Hello there.
-Huh?

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:08.290
Yurine!

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.260
It's been a while.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:12.970
Weren't you lonely without me?

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:15.930
You were gone?
I didn't even notice.

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:20.310
What do you mean?
I was gone for three light-years!

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:24.390
You have no idea what I went through
to come back!

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:27.270
I really don't care.
Oh, you dropped this.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:31.570
Right! Beth is getting bigger
and stronger!

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:34.360
She's becoming a huge threat

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:35.820
to our lives...?

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:37.620
There, there. Good girl.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:39.780
Don't ignore me.

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:44.080
Now, since you punched Beth
earlier...

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:49.710
In the name of Beth,
I will punish you!

00:05:58.010 --> 00:06:00.100
I'm the victim here!

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:02.100
I don't deserve the punishment!

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:03.770
I'll punish you!

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:07.150
I give up. She's completely
lost her mind.

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:08.860
No use talking.

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:11.320
Which do you prefer?
A punch or a kick?

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:14.280
What's your preference?

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:15.490
A punch.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:22.830
Now, it's dinner time for us too.

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:27.120
I'll fix you up with superglue
so make sure to bring it.

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.000
Crazy bitch.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:33.170
Coming up, the swimsuit edition!

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:34.800
Don't miss it!

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.360
Yes!

00:06:57.530 --> 00:07:00.530
There's nobody here but us!

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:05.620
Can't believe she won
a free private beach trip for six

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.790
in the Suzuran
Shopping District raffle!

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:11.580
Yurine has great luck!

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:13.250
Of course I do.

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:14.840
Smile!

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.420
Yay!

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:19.470
Lord, please forgive me.

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:23.810
I've surrendered
to the devil's temptation yet again.

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:27.020
I, Pekola, am a sinful angel.

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:32.190
But who could say no to barbeque?

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.230
Look at this beach.

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:40.740
It's been 3000 years since I went
swimming in the Dead Sea.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:44.160
The Dead Sea is a lake, not an ocean.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:47.370
-Keep the beach clean, guys.
-Got it!

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:48.620
Oh, yeah.

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:51.080
-Bring back all the trash.
-Got it!

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:54.040
I noticed there's a new devil
in the mix.

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:55.960
-Jashin-chan!
-What?

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:58.920
Your swimsuit is adorable!

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:02.220
It's not adorable, it's strong!

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:04.390
Did you really need to wear that?

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:07.640
Who doesn't wear a swimsuit
to the beach?

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:11.270
We never see eye to eye.

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:14.810
Pekola!

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:16.230
Yes?

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:19.490
Well, that was suspicious.

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:21.400
-Jashin-chan.
-It's nothing.

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:23.200
-What's up?
-What is it?

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:26.450
What are you hiding?
Show us!

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:29.120
No! Please stop.

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:32.370
No need to be shy.
What have you got to lose?

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:33.630
Stop!

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:35.460
Don't be obnoxious.

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:40.130
Tajiri?

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:42.130
Your last name is Tajiri?

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:44.180
Pekola Tajiri, huh?

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:45.640
Hello there.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:48.770
I'm Persephone II, the devil
who came from hell

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:50.770
to look for Jashin-chan.

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:52.850
Nice to meet you, Ms. Tajiri!

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:54.850
Nice to meet--
No!

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:58.110
I just borrowed this
from a co-worker.

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.650
You know I don't have a last name.

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:01.820
Really, Tajiri?

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:04.280
-Got it, Tajiri.
-Tajiri-chan.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:06.490
Stop calling me Tajiri!

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:10.040
Hey, Pekola.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:15.540
I just... I just wanted to say
you look cute in a swimsuit too.

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.460
Really?

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:18.800
It's true.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:20.760
You should be punished for it.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.880
It looks too good on you, Pekola.

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:31.770
I'm so cute!

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:36.060
It's so hot!

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:38.940
I can't wear sandals
so the sand feels hot!

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:40.480
Catch me if you can!

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:43.320
Jashin-chan!
You have to warm up first!

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:45.610
Not listening!

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.120
Vega pose!

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:51.040
One, two, three, four!

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:53.000
One, two, three, four!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.080
Warm-ups are crucial.

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:56.870
-Yup!
-Yes.

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:08.970
My foot, I mean,
my tail's cramped up!

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:11.600
Looks so fun, I'm so jealous.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:15.770
But since I can't swim,
I'll make a sand castle.

00:10:17.270 --> 00:10:22.070
Scoop, scoop, scoop!

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:27.160
That was a close call.

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.820
Ice! Ice!

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:32.580
How about some refreshing
shaved ice?

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:34.250
Hey, it's Yusa and Koji.

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:37.210
-Welcome.
-Yes, yes!

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:40.500
Yes, yes! How about
an exciting French kiss?

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:43.210
Or do you prefer
an unforgettable deep kiss?

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:46.510
Actually, they're the same thing.

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:48.840
I'd like one shaved ice, please!

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:56.270
So cold and refreshing!
Shaved ice is the best!

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:00.770
You want some, Tajiri?

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:04.570
Not until you spin three times
and bark.

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.110
Woof.

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:10.530
She really did it!

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:12.780
-Please...?
-Not yet!

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:14.240
Give me a paw.

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.450
Jashin-chan.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.750
Are you bullying Pekola?

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:21.500
It's a misunderstanding.

00:11:21.670 --> 00:11:24.250
Pekola wanted shaved ice...

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:27.420
Seems like you haven't been
disciplined enough.

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:29.260
Jashin-chan.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.800
You'll get sunburned like that.

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:33.600
Here's a parasol.

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:36.810
But why are you closing it up?

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:41.100
Cut!

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:51.110
-Yay!
-Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:53.870
Here.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.410
I'm sorry Jashin-chan bullied you.

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:00.620
Are you sure? Thanks.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:03.380
I've been dreaming about you.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:07.510
Cold and delicious!

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:10.380
The brain freeze feels so good!

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:12.470
How's the ice?

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:15.640
Devils...?

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:19.520
Shoot! This shaved ice
was produced by devils.

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:21.390
Does it taste good?

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:27.400
Yes. It's very good.

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:28.820
I'm glad.

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:30.070
Thank you.

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:37.330
What is it?

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:38.580
Hey, Koji.

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:41.080
It's rude to stare like that.

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:44.000
Look who's talking.

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:46.960
I'll change your name
to Tsugumitsu!

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:48.420
Who's that?

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:52.050
Noto's Suzu District
military commander, Tsugumitsu Yusa!

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:54.430
Yusa, Koji! She's an angel!

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:57.100
Don't let your guard down,
she'll kill you!

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:00.140
What was that?

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:06.310
She says you're more of a threat.

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:07.480
What?

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:10.320
-You little brat, Koji Tsugumitsu!
-Quit that.

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:13.450
I'll skin you and rub salt
all over your body.

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:16.320
So cold to the touch, feels good!

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:26.830
Making friends with an angel?
Don't make me laugh!

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.130
You guys are idiots!

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:31.590
Dumbasses!

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:48.230
They're all so annoying.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:59.120
Such idiots.

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.330
Is it about time?

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:15.840
What's that?

00:14:16.010 --> 00:14:17.300
It's a kraken!

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:20.680
-From Norse mythology?
-Yup!

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:22.930
Jashin-chan!

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:24.810
Medusa!

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:30.310
Hurry up and save me!
Save me from...

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:31.520
What's his name?

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:33.900
How should I know?

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:35.740
Just save me!

00:14:37.570 --> 00:14:39.200
Hey, Mr. Kraken!

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:42.950
Could you please let go
of Jashin-chan?

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:45.960
Idiot!

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.290
Hey!

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:51.420
-Jashin-chan!
-Something cracked!

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:55.420
If you're hungry, Medusa's
a lot more flavorful than I am.

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:57.050
Take my spot, Medusa!

00:14:57.220 --> 00:15:00.390
I'm worth a lot more than you!

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:02.810
Look over there, big guy!

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:05.680
Eat that girl over there!

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:08.100
-Seriously?
-How despicable.

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:09.980
She really is.

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:12.270
Come on, what are you waiting for?

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.940
Wait! Don't eat me!

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:18.360
-He ate her.
-Just like that.

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:20.240
Guys!

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.950
She's still your friend, right?

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:26.450
I know she's a sleaze,
but we have to save her!

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:28.870
Change of plans.

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:33.170
-We'll have seafood tonight.
-Where did that come from?

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:34.880
That's fine with me.

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:36.800
Me too!

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.340
I'll cheer you on!

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.840
Let's take care of him, quick!

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:52.360
Devil blow!

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:31.440
-Are you okay?
-Yes.

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:48.790
Kraken!

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:02.470
That armor's cool!
Hand it over!

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:04.260
You can't do that!

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.680
-How about next time?
-Promise?

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:10.060
I gotta be dead, right?

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:11.770
Your body melted.

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:13.520
Are you okay?

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.400
Does it look like I am?

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:20.400
This is all because Yurine
summoned me here in the first place.

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:26.370
Or else I would've never come
to the beach!

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:27.950
Look at me!

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:31.750
Yurine's to blame for all of this!

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:35.540
I despise you...

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.290
I hate you!

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:40.420
-What's happening?
-Jashin-chan?

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:51.640
Give me the answer I desire!

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:54.230
Ancient woman warrior!

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:58.270
Amazon!

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:08.160
-Here?
-Just hurry up and strip!

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:09.830
This thing too!

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:12.240
-Take it all off!
-Oh, no!

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:22.000
Look at me in this awesome armor!

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:23.960
You savage.

00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:27.680
Victory's mine! I'll finish her!

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:28.970
Goodbye, Yurine!

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:33.850
You never learn, huh?

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:36.940
Fine, I'll fight you.

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:16.980
Beth!

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:27.900
Beth?

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:35.410
You're gonna end up dead,
just like Yurine!

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:42.170
Beth!

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:12.990
I won't let you get away
with this!

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:17.370
Full Armor
Jashin-chan Dropkick!

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:26.340
The battle

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:29.340
still

00:20:29.510 --> 00:20:31.680
continues...

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:44.020
Looks delicious!

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:46.940
What do you wanna eat first?

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:49.690
This smells so good!

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:52.320
It melts in my mouth.

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:53.820
I wanna eat it all.

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:03.170
There we go.

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:25.270
Delicious!

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:31.530
Who knew kraken tasted so good?

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:33.490
Let me try!

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:35.740
Delicious!

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:38.120
Me too, me too!

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:43.120
They know they're eating kraken, right?

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:46.080
Have a bite, Pekola.

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:49.380
There's no way-- I mean,

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:51.710
-I'm quite full--
-Here.

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:00.970
Delicious!

00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:03.020
Eat up, Pekola.

00:22:03.180 --> 00:22:05.060
Here's another piece.

00:22:05.690 --> 00:22:07.480
Yes, please.

00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:24.370
I know you're not a lefty.

00:22:32.000 --> 00:22:34.880
I can feed myself,
I'm not a baby!

00:22:35.050 --> 00:22:38.090
I don't need your help at all,
Yurine.

00:22:38.260 --> 00:22:39.890
Mind your own business!

00:22:41.850 --> 00:22:43.680
Let's have a peaceful dinner.

00:22:44.730 --> 00:22:47.230
Fine. I'll be helped.

00:22:47.390 --> 00:22:49.650
Here, say, "Ah."

00:22:49.810 --> 00:22:52.110
Really?

00:22:52.270 --> 00:22:54.150
Shut up and eat.

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:07.040
It's so good-- Huh?

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:14.760
Didn't realize you were that close
with the witch.

00:23:14.920 --> 00:23:15.920
Tajiri!

00:23:16.090 --> 00:23:18.510
-They're not close.
-Not at all.

00:23:18.680 --> 00:23:19.840
They're intimate!

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:23.140
-Not at all!
-Don't be shy.

00:23:23.310 --> 00:23:24.520
Just admit it.

00:23:24.680 --> 00:23:26.810
What the hell are you talking about?

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:29.690
Admit it, just admit it.

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:32.190
Just admit it!

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:40.110
Damn it!
You're all gonna regret this later!
